## Configuration file for League of Legends Database

## Database connection settings
DATABASE_HOST=database-host.example.com
DATABASE_PORT=5432
DATABASE_NAME=database-name
DATABASE_USERNAME=database-username
DATABASE_PASSWORD=database-password

## Configuration for API access
## Data Dragon API base URL
DDRAGON_API_URL=https://address-from-server.com

## Configuration resilience4j
RESILIENCE4J_MAX_ATTEMPTS=3
RESILIENCE4J_WAIT_DURATION=2s
RESILIENCE4J_ENABLE_EXPONENTIAL_BACKOFF=true